Open Food Facts data
The community-*.json files are an adapted database drawn from Open Food
Facts by its contributors. The Open Database License 1.0 applies to this
adapted database, and the Database Contents License 1.0 applies to its
individual contents. The software permission above does not restrict
rights granted under those licenses.

Source database and downloads
https://world.openfoodfacts.org/data

Open Database License 1.0
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Database Contents License 1.0
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

Cupping Room filtered the source for coffee records, normalized descriptors
and quantities, mapped product fields and retained source identifiers and
observation dates. The complete community database used by this plugin is
provided as machine-readable UTF-8 JSON in
skills/coffee-guide/catalog/community-*.json within this plugin.
The roaster-profiles.json file contains Cupping Room's separate editorial catalog.
